The card as drafted goes to Quinn Ashdown with you in cc, offering Monday Nov 16 9:45–10:15am, Tuesday Nov 17 3:15–3:45pm, and Thursday Nov 19 9:45–10:15am, all free on your side, with a line saying you've shortened it to 30 minutes and would like to do it virtually rather than at the office. It doesn't introduce me again since my first note already reached her.

One thing to confirm: your ask said virtual, so the card drops the Bay 4 visit — if you still want her to come by the space, say so and I'll redo it. Approve sends it."}}

